+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` with `{"toOrgId":"globex"}` moves a
+user (for example between group companies).
+
+- The caller must be an org admin of `{orgID}`. A caller in another
+  organization, or an unknown `{orgID}`, → 404. A member who is not an org admin → 403.
+- The user must be in `{orgID}` (otherwise 404). `toOrgId` must be an existing
+  organization (otherwise 400) and not the user's current one (400).
+- The move is all or nothing. The user's memberships in projects of the old
+  organization are removed, and tasks assigned to them in those projects are
+  unassigned. The user's org admin right is cleared, because it belongs to the
+  organization they leave.
+
